---
source: crates/xudo-policy/tests/contract_snapshots.rs
expression: table
---
 1  unknown_action
    no rule defines this action; run `xudo list` to see what is permitted, or ask an administrator to add a rule
 2  argv_rejected
    the action exists but these arguments are not permitted; run `xudo explain -- <argv>` to see which position was rejected
 3  deny_listed
    this is permanently denied by a compiled-in rule and no configuration can allow it; do not retry, and do not look for a variant that slips past
 4  policy_unloadable
    the ruleset is invalid and xudo is failing closed; an administrator must run `xudo check` and repair it
 5  frozen
    an administrator froze the agent path; the human path still works, so hand this action to a person
 6  no_confirmation_channel
    this action needs human approval and no channel is live; ask the operator to run `xudo watch` in a terminal they control
 7  human_path_only
    this action is never available to an agent; hand it to a person
 8  exe_mismatch
    this action runs a different program than the one requested; run `xudo list` to find the action that names this program
